※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4211 LANG_CALL_WRONG_ARGUMENT_COUNT

※ A call hands over exactly what the function takes.  Nothing is variadic and
※ nothing has a default, so a count that does not match is a mistake.
fn twice(n: u8) → u8:
    n ⊞ n

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    twice(1u8, 2u8)
